    {
      "id": "claim_d78b4f78b7cc4e67bafff8c5f0ea932e",
      "statement": "The project's memory-update mechanism is scoped to non-parametric (textual) memory by design; parametric memory-editing methods (MEND, KnowledgeEditor, PersonalityEdit, APP, MAC) are out of implementation scope but retained as a rejected alternative in the Sub 2.2 architecture document.",
