    {
      "id": "claim_5754d31b64154eea85af19b82ec6374c",
      "statement": "The project resolved (20/08/2026, with the tutor, formal channel) that the mechanism's own 'reinforcement learning' is not SFT but a harness adjustment driven by an explicit binary user signal (thumbs up/down), placing it closer to Reflexion's verbal/no-gradient RL family than to Retroformer/Memory-R1's literal policy-gradient fine-tuning.",
      "evidence": [
