      "statement": "The project corrects Zhang et al.'s claim (§6.3) that no dedicated benchmark existed for direct evaluation of memory modules, noting LoCoMo and LongMemEval closed that gap within months, though both remain indirect (end-to-end QA accuracy) rather than pure Reference Accuracy evaluation.",
