      "statement": "The project's insight-mining scope for output correctness/groundedness is split into three categories: (a) execution/procedural failure (deterministic, in scope), (b) groundedness-as-presence (a deterministic substring-match proxy, in scope), and (c) groundedness-as-semantic-correctness (requires an LLM-as-judge or human, explicitly out of v1 scope) — a working resolution not yet formally written into the decision log.",
